    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so quiet in here. i keep waiting to hear him jump on the bed or the sound of his food bowl clicking, but there's nothing. it feels like the house is just... empty. like there's no point to anything if the only thing that actually loved me is gone. everything just feels so pointless now.",
